 * ░█░█░█▀█░█░█░█▀▄░█▀█░█▀▄░░░░░░░░░█▀▄░█▀█░▀█▀░▀█▀░█▀▀░█▀▄░█░█
 * ░█▄█░█▀█░░█░░█▀▄░█▀█░█▀▄░░░▄▄▄░░░█▀▄░█▀█░░█░░░█░░█▀▀░█▀▄░░█░
 * ░▀░▀░▀░▀░░▀░░▀▀░░▀░▀░▀░▀░░░░░░░░░▀▀░░▀░▀░░▀░░░▀░░▀▀▀░▀░▀░░▀░
 */

{
  "battery": {
    "bat": "BAT0",
    "interval": 30,

    "states": {
      "warning": 30,
      "critical": 15,
    },

    "format": "{icon} {capacity}%",
    "format-full": "󱟢 {capacity}%",
    "format-plugged": "󰚥 {capacity}%",
    "format-charging": "{icon} {capacity}%",

    "tooltip-format": "Capacity     : {capacity}\nHealth       : {health}%\nCycles       : {cycles}",

    "format-icons": {
      "default": ["󰂎", "󰁺", "󰁻", "󰁼", "󰁽", "󰁾", "󰁿", "󰂀", "󰂁", "󰂂", "󰁹"],
      "charging": ["󰢟", "󰢜", "󰂆", "󰂇", "󰂈", "󰢝", "󰂉", "󰢞", "󰂊", "󰂋", "󰂅"],
    },
  },

  "upower": {
    /*
     * #upower
     * #upower.charging
     * #upower.discharging
     * #upower.full
     * #upower.empty
     * #upower.unknown-status
     */

    "icon-size": 25,
    "hide-if-empty": true,

    "format": "{percentage}",

    "tooltip": true,
    "tooltip-spacing": 20,
  },
}
